- Andy.

286
00:19:35,209 --> 00:19:40,715
No sé qué le ve a Shane.
Es decir, no es amable.

287
00:19:44,010 --> 00:19:45,595
Solo es un idiota.

288
00:19:47,013 --> 00:19:48,973
Como sea, no importa.

289
00:19:51,851 --> 00:19:56,772
