Tonto Rooney.

305
00:21:04,878 --> 00:21:07,297
Lo juro, estoy harto de este gato.

306
00:21:19,101 --> 00:21:21,103
Rooney, si no te callas,

307
00:21:21,270 --> 00:21:23,438
