478
00:34:53,425 --> 00:34:54,509
Un idiota.

479
00:34:54,759 --> 00:34:56,386
¡Maldito niño!

480
00:34:57,596 --> 00:34:58,305
¡Oye!

481
00:34:59,848 --> 00:35:02,517
Si te molesto, dilo, ¿sí?

482
00:35:02,684 --> 00:35:04,102
No uses a tu muñequito.

483
00:35:05,061 --> 00:35:05,770
¡Mamá!

484
00:35:05,937 --> 00:35:08,398
